"Later Nathan's second class carried Regenerative Focus; years later it became Limitless Focus."
"Limitless Focus: \"Your Focus will replenish very quickly when you have capacity for thought.\""
"Nathan's Focus maximum rose by 10 per level, from 7730 at level 763 to 9610 at level 951."
"Nathan spends Stamina and Focus to stay conscious against strong poison."
"Nathan's Talent spends Focus to rebuild his body from scraps; he dies only with both pools empty."
"Nathan's Focus burning bright helps him resist mental and social skills."
"In his last war Nathan's Focus fell to 0/9070."
"Khachi's class resource was Faith; Nascent Divine would have turned it to worship."
"Aarl's class resource is Stamina; Sarah's is Focus."
